  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nYour own private resort, right here at home!\r\n\r\nDiscover a home where privacy, architectural flair and relaxed resort-style living come together. Set quietly back from the road, this substantial concrete home enjoys a sheltered, peaceful setting with a wonderful flow to the outdoor living areas. From the moment you arrive, you feel a sense of escape, as though you have stepped into your own private holiday retreat.\r\n\r\nThe main home offers four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a guest powder room, complemented by a double internal access garage and additional off-street parking. Solid concrete & weatherboard construction, along with its distinctive architectural style, enhances its appeal.\r\n\r\nAdding another dimension is the legal two-bedroom flat, complete with its own entrance, outdoor area and car park. Ideal for extended family wanting independence while staying close, or an opportunity to generate additional income.\r\n\r\nIf privacy, space and a relaxed lifestyle are high on your wish list, this property deserves your attention. Enjoy the feeling of being tucked away from the world, while remaining within easy reach of local beaches, Mairangi Bay Village and Pupuke Golf Course. Zoned for sought-after schools: Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools,  Murrays Bay Intermediate, Campbells Bay Primary, and Mairangi Bay Primary schools.\r\n\r\nA distinctive home with room for family, flexibility for the future and a lifestyle that feels like a holiday every day.",
